es.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349916.jpg"},{"title":"K2","synopsis":"Teen sees a map of the new world. But it includes precious information that may lead to further conflicts.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349917.jpg"},{"title":"Praying","synopsis":"In order to evade the pursuit from the New U.N. forces, the Ulysses enters the Dohla Vira again.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349918.jpg"},{"title":"Reunite","synopsis":"In order to reunite with Gould and his Ulysses crew, Keel, Josie and Teen manage to stow away on a floating dock that departs from Tibet.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349919.jpg"},{"title":"The Globe","synopsis":"As he is about to face execution, Keel must gamble for his life with the dock’s captain; the same captain who once caught him cheating.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349920.jpg"},{"title":"Separation","synopsis":"Keel, Teen, and Josie managed to bypass the attack of the new UN Forces leading to the dock of the ULYSSES.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349921.jpg"},{"title":"Battle of Metasequoia","synopsis":"Having defeated the silent submarine from Wei Nation, the Ulysses finds itself at the sea of Metasaquoia engaged in the ultimate confrontation.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349922.jpg"},{"title":"Blue","synopsis":"Keel and Teen come to the conclusion that the only way to produce a long-lasting peace is to share their father's map with the entire world.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81228/349923.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
